# Tranquil Frillback: "you may pay {G} up to three times. When you pay this cost one or more times, choose up to that many".
# Bot1 floats {G}{G}{G} from Black Lotus with the enters trigger on the stack and pays {G} three times in the one payment
# (CR 118.12, 603.12a): the pool is empty right after. The reflexive ability triggers once for the three payments (CR 603.12a) -
# no second choice of modes, one item on the stack - and may choose all three modes (CR 700.2b), done in printed order (CR 608.2c): Bot2's Sol Ring is destroyed
# first, so the graveyard exiled next holds it beside Bot2's Black Lotus, and Bot1 gains exactly 4 life.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Tranquil Frillback
Forest x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Sol Ring
Island x17

